```text
Lighthouse 12 (desktop, MacBook Pro M3, no throttling)
Performance  98
  Largest Contentful Paint  0.9 s
  Total Blocking Time       30 ms
  Cumulative Layout Shift   0.01
```

Statement: "A Lighthouse score of 98 shows that the menu page passes INP for real users."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'False. Lighthouse is a lab test: one page load on one machine, and nobody taps anything, so it cannot measure Interaction to Next Paint at all (Total Blocking Time is only a lab proxy). The Core Web Vitals assessment uses field data: the 75th percentile of real visits, from the Chrome UX Report or your own RUM beacons, on the phones your users really have. A fast laptop without throttling hides exactly the long tasks a budget Android phone feels.', 1, 5
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM challenge.questions WHERE challenge_id = (SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_fwp_111') AND order_index = 1)
