average 219 ms
```

Statement: "The assessment reads the 75th percentile, which is 520 ms here, so the page is rated poor even though 70% of visits were fast."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'True. Sorted, the 75th of 100 visits is one of the 520 ms ones, and an INP above 500 ms is poor (good is at most 200 ms, poor above 500 ms). The 75th percentile is chosen on purpose: a page passes only when at least three visits in four are good. The average (219 ms) hides the 30% of users who wait half a second after every tap.', 2, 5
